### 1. Home / Documentation Route
GET http://localhost:3000/

###

### 2. Retrieve All Books (GET /books/)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

###

### 3. Retrieve a Single Book by ID (GET /books/:bookId/)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

###

### 4. Add a New Book (POST /books/)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Power of Habit",
  "author": "Charles Duhigg",
  "price": 420,
  "pages": 371
}

###

### 5. Update an Existing Book by ID (PUT /books/:bookId/)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Atomic Habits (Updated Edition)",
  "author": "James Clear",
  "price": 499,
  "pages": 320
}

###

### 6. Delete a Book by ID (DELETE /books/:bookId/)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/8/

###

### 7. Test Non-Existent Book (404 Handler)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999/
